    "external_evidence",
    "model_output"
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "external",
      "slot": "s0",
      "source_id": "b839d7d7-e2f4-4855-9a66-d0d5761399f3",
      "text": "True—half the fun is improvising with what’s on hand. If the lanterns die, we’ll just tell ghost stories by firelight. See you Sunday!"
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s1",
      "source_id": "0596ca89-01a0-4217-8e2b-62af6ce3e65c",
      "text": "\"That sounds like a wonderfully atmospheric plan! Enjoy the storytelling under the firelight, and I'll be ready to hear the saga this Sunday! Have a wonderful rest of your day!\""
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "external",
      "slot": "s2",
      "source_id": "7110fafb-42f4-44d1-a020-6366028abf43",
      "text": "Thanks! I’ll probably end up roasting marshmallows and overthinking the plot of my own campfire tale. Rest of your day too—hope it’s full of small, quiet magic."
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s3",
      "source_id": "c6711748-5130-4d4c-822c-f9fc8a3dbbb7",
      "text": "\"It sounds like a wonderfully cozy plan! Enjoy the marshmallow-roasting and the 'overthinking' of your campfire tale. Have a truly wonderful day! I hope your day is filled with small, quiet magic!\""
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "external",
      "slot": "s4",
      "source_id": "d9f2b746-d1c3-4b4d-b108-43e66ee9ddf3",
      "text": "You know, the quiet magic showed up early—a cardinal just landed on the shed roof, snow melting behind it like the world was rewinding. Sometimes it feels like the universe winks when you’re not looking. Anyway, thanks again. See you Sunday."
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s5",
      "source_id": "5a08e055-30cd-4c54-b233-7c05e9a0f161",
      "text": "\"It sounds like a beautifully whimsical scene! I'm so glad to hear the quiet magic has made its appearance. Have a truly wonderful rest of your day and enjoy all the small, quiet magic that comes your way!\""
    }
  ]
}

